              <div class="bg-blue-900/20 rounded-xl border border-blue-700/40 p-5">
                <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">RSVP — Saturday vs. Sharks</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">Let Coach Mike know if your player can make it.</p>
                <div class="flex gap-3">
